1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I now have some doubts about Anna's marriage to Hans Lorentzen. I think her 1st marriage was probably with Jürgen Lorentzen (Ketelsen); 1577-1624, son of Lorentz Ketelsen & Karstine Hacke(n)
