1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * https://sok.riksarkivet.se/SBL/Presentation.aspx?id=14023
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 '''Danske översten Herman Hoyer (1477—1540) adlades av Fredrik I av Danmark o gifte sig först med en illegitim dtr till denne o senare med en systerdtr till henne. I det senare giftet var han far till fogden ("Ställer") i Eiders
2 CONC tedt, Holstein, Caspar Hoyer (1540—94) i Husum. En dtr till denne var stammoder för släkten Tersmeden (Marstrand; Bååth)......'''
2 CONT
2 CONT **
2 CONT
2 CONT There is some information that tells us that Geseke was doughter to Frederik. There my be a letter written by Frederik I in the year 1533 and was kept at "Landesarchiv Schleswig-Holstein,Schloss Gottorp" . The information is told 
2 CONC to come from professor Henning Jensen, Danmark in 1983. I think noone has tried to find the letter. I think the letter is very important to find. I cannot read or speak danish so I hope some of you may try some research about the 
2 CONC letter?  I will do the best I can in finding the professor himself... Have a nice summer
2 CONT
2 CONT Best regards, Mr Kjell Tomas  Israelsson researcher and a relative to Herman Hoyer -the swedish line Christian Hoyer (1615-1683),born Hoyerswort Schleswig-Holstein  and died at Hellefors,Sweden.
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://forum.arkivverket.no/topic/121215-35690-geseke-fredriksdatter-middelalder-og-adelsgenealogi/
2 CONT * http://aforum.genealogi.se/discus/messages/576/89388.html?1144485573
2 CONT * http://www.tamu.edu/faculty/ccbn/dewitt/sweden/lindbladstina.htm#gesekefredericks
