1 NAME Jørgen /Olufsen Felthus/
2 GIVN Jørgen
2 SURN Olufsen Felthus
2 _MARNM Olufsen Felthus
1 NAME Jørgen //
2 GIVN Jørgen
2 SURN Olufsen
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1570
2 PLAC Horsens
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 2 OCT 1645
2 PLAC Ålborg
2 ADDR
3 CITY Ålborg
3 STAE Ålborg
