2 CONT * Siblings: Jakob Johan Djurklow, Carl Daniel Djurklow, Christina Catharina Djurklow, Nils Djurklou, Gustaf Filip Djurklow, Anna Maria Djurklow, Gustaf Fredrik Djurklow, Carl Ulrik Djurklow
2 CONT * Husband: Thomas Terssmeden Cedercreutz Paron
2 CONT * Children: Christina Elisabeth Billberg (born Tersmeden), Anna Maria Cederborgh (born Tersmeden), Beata Regina Falk (born Tersmeden), Margareta Charlotta Linman (born Tersmeden)<br/>
