2 CONT
2 CONT . 	3. Christopher Hansen Lilliefeld,   d. eft. 1556
2 CONT
2 CONT .	4. Dorete Hansdatter Lilliefeld,   d. 1563, Malmö (Malmø), Skåne, Sverige 
2 CONT
