0 @N6000000004045181510@ NOTE Rector of Nakskov 19. nov. 1620, ordained 3. sept. 1621.
1 CONT Clergyman in Nordberg, became Bishop.
1 CONT Hans Mikkelsen was his close friend. His oldest daughter was married to a clergyman in Adersballe, S.P. Rhodius, who was a student at Roskilde, 1645. This Rhodius was a fine man, but was shamefully treated by the Swedes, when unde
1 CONC r King Carl the 10th Gustav, 1657 - 1658, they invaded Denmark. They confiscated his goods and at last hung him up by his beard. The youngest of his daughters was married to Rhodius, the successor in Adersballe of the Clergyman C.
1 CONC  Møller.
